description: '''This mod adds 2 planets sharing a single campaign to the game.

You [stat]WILL[] be forced to work with excruciatingly hideous structures that output 4 different liquids and require gigantic factory setups to just run. yes. 

The mod is still wip. 
Only 6 sectors have been made as of now.
'''
